  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PHAMSA is a partnership of organisations led by IOM with the objectives of building capacity among stakeholders in HIV/AIDS prevention and mitigation activities for mobile groups, through direct inputs and research. The target groups are: SADC governments, sectors employing migrants, trade unions, NGOs working with mobile populations, and various categories of mobile groups.</narrative>
